"<qt>"
"<p>Enter an expression to filter. Filters can be defined as either:"
"<ul>"
"<li>a shell-style wildcard, e.g. <tt>http://www.example.com/ads*</tt>, the wildcards <tt>*?[]</tt> may be used</li>"
